it's OK.

37
00:02:25,570 --> 00:02:30,470
But you can get more
information on a different area.

38
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:33,940

39
00:02:33,940 --> 00:02:38,920
I will talk about several
aspects of transformers,

40
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:45,520
and I will generally follow the
history of large language model

41
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:50,140
and say why are we here.

42
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:55,510
It's about the large language
model introduction and history.

43
00:02:55,510 --> 00:02:58,450
And how did we get here?

44
00:02:58,450 --> 00:03:01,690
It's about some
practical techniques

45
00:03:01,690 --> 00:03:04,540
for training large
language models.

46
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:06,790
And what are we working on?

47
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:12,400
It's about the last one year
of the real language models

48
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:16,480
and other techniques
